                0.149
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 解: \\(\\because x(t) = \\sin 200\\pi t + 2\\sin 400\\pi t\\)  \n\\(\\therefore x(w) = j\\pi [\\sqrt{w + 200\\pi} + \\sqrt{w - 200\\pi}] + 2j\\pi [\\sqrt{w + 400\\pi} + \\sqrt{w - 400\\pi}]\\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "bbox": [
                0.26,
                0.143,
                0.648,
                0.319
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.315,
                0.469,
                0.37
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\sin^ {2} 4 0 0 \\pi t = \\frac {1 - \\cos 8 0 0 \\pi t}{2}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.113,
                0.37,
                0.537,
                0.417
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\(\\sqrt{2}x_{1}|t|=x_{1}|t\\cdot\\sin^{2}400\\tan t=x_{1}|t\\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.567,
                0.342,
                1.0,
                0.392
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\frac {1 - \\cos 8 0 0 \\pi t}{2} = \\frac {\\lambda (t)}{2} - \\frac {1}{2} \\lambda (t) \\cdot \\cos 8 0 0 \\pi t\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.145,
                0.416,
                0.707,
                0.471
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\therefore x _ {1} (w) = \\frac {x (w)}{2} - \\frac {1}{4} [ x (w + 8 0 0 \\pi) + x (w - 8 0 0 \\pi) ]\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.151,
                0.466,
                0.907,
                0.526
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "由于 \\( Y(w) = x_1(w) \\cdot H(w) \\)，其中 \\( H(w) \\) 频域范围为 -400π 到 400π",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.525,
                0.575,
                0.576
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "故只需关注 \\(x_{1}(w)\\) 该范围图形.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.153,
                0.586,
                0.594,
                0.64
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\( \\therefore Y\\left( w\\right) \\) 在 \\( - {400}\\pi \\) 到 \\( {400}\\pi \\) 国形为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "bbox": [
                0.253,
                0.628,
                0.6,
                0.831
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
